[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/lib/vault.py: Implemented vault library interface: @data_type exception hierarchy (VaultError, InsufficientFundsError, VaultInactiveException) and @poly_type Vault protocol with contract docstrings; replaced bare pretense import with full package path.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/lib/inter_interface.py: Implemented allocator library interface: @data_type exception hierarchy (AllocatorError, AllocationLimitError) and @poly_type Allocator protocol with contract docstrings; imports use package-qualified pretense path and sibling vault import.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/lib/vault_impl.py: Implemented Vault singleton: tier='system', __init__ backs _balance=0/_is_active=True, balance/is_active properties, deposit/withdraw enforce amount and activity contracts, test-only set_active; auto-generated __initialize__ preserved.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/lib/inter_interface_impl.py: Implemented Allocator singleton: tier='system', __init__ backs _allocated=0, allocated property, allocate validates positive amount (AllocationLimitError) then delegates withdraw to get_singleton(vault.Vault) and increments, release validates bounds then delegates deposit and decrements; auto-generated __initialize__ preserved.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/tests/vault_impl_test.py: Added unit tests for vault_impl covering initial state invariant, deposit/withdraw balance updates, set_active toggling, and inactive-vault VaultInactiveException branches with postcondition assertions.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/inter_interface/tests/inter_interface_impl_test.py: Added unit tests for inter_interface_impl covering zero initial allocated invariant, allocate/release vault delegation and cumulative allocated updates, plus inactive-vault VaultInactiveException branches using a lightweight MockVault collaborator.
